## Task 3 — Keep-alive API route
Create app/api/ping/route.ts:
- Method: GET
- Run: select 1 from search_events limit 1 using Supabase client
- Return { ok: true, timestamp: new Date().toISOString() }
- Use createClient directly with env vars
- export const dynamic = 'force-dynamic'

